    "updated_at": "2022-10-13T08:50:31Z",
    "body": "How would a webpage know whether autocorrection is supported by the UA or not? Site might provide its own correction as a fallback.\r\nI could imagine that on less common OSes and especially when using less common languages autocorrection isn't always available.\r\nI guess there are similar issues with spellchecking too though. ",
